            ],
            "text": "Daniel: a lean, dignified Judean man, grave and greying; olive-brown skin; close-cropped greying hair and a short trimmed grey beard; deep-set, steady eyes and a calm, thoughtful face. Signature outfit: a long undyed linen tunic under a plain indigo wool cloak with a blue fringed hem. Props: a small leather scroll case slung at the hip."
          }
        ]
      },
